<title>UK: Lehman sets warrants on Japanese share basket.</title>
<headline>Lehman sets warrants on Japanese share basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers Finance SA said it has issued 500,000 European-style warrants on a basket of Japanese export shares.</p>
<p> REDEMPTION	$100 **		   ISSUE PRICE  $100</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   14.MAY.99		 PAYDATE	29.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG</p>
<p> NOTES	     **PLUS INDEX APPRECIAION</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
